{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.poster.avif?t=1769783395\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.webm?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/66bd8af5d07658f40fb00977d8e6c22e.mp4?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget swords and axes. Here, the battles take place in the minds of the heroes: cute monks and elderly folks with a single goal \u2014 to meditate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy. Stress, bills, heartbreaks, and other enemies will try to disturb our heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.poster.avif?t=1769783395\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.webm?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c77a7890d03476fa2ff1f699a0dababc.mp4?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your weapon is music!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a deck of pieces to prevent enemies from disturbing the monks\u2019 peace.<br>Gain XP and coins, collect relics, and increase your powers. Play your instrument and defeat all enemies in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hand-drawn scenarios! Reaching the end will require skillful combinations of the right pieces and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.poster.avif?t=1769783395\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.webm?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/extras/c990c011baa71ef5a9eb6a3c015f6d1b.mp4?t=1769783395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 unique characters (and counting), each playing a different instrument</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies trying to disturb the monks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack composed exclusively for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All artwork hand-drawn by professional human illustrator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189950?t=1769783395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769783395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/a633de82ab6cb592e347737b92520dad1476fcc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769783395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189950/a633de82ab6cb592e347737b92520dad1476fcc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769783395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","